    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Past, present and future",
     "texto": [
      "In the past, the verb agrees with the subject: **-л** (masculine), **-ла** (feminine), **-ло** (neuter), **-ли** (plural). In the indicative, the imperfective non-past expresses the present (**готовлю**, «I prepare / I am preparing»); the perfective non-past expresses the future (**приготовлю**, «I will prepare»).",
      "**Уже** means «already», but on its own it does not require the perfective: **Я уже прочитал книгу** = «I have already finished the book»; **Я уже читаю книгу** = «I am already reading the book»."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
